{"1":{"w":[{"c":"تَبَّتْ","d":"tabbat","e":"Perish"},{"c":"يَدَا","d":"yadā","e":"(the) hands"},{"c":"أَبِي","d":"abī","e":"(of) Abu"},{"c":"لَهَبٍ","d":"lahabin","e":"Lahab"},{"c":"وَتَبَّ","d":"watabba","e":"and perish he"}],"a":{"g":"May the hands of Abu Lahab be ruined, and ruined is he."}},"2":{"w":[{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"Not"},{"c":"أَغْنَى","d":"aghnā","e":"(will) avail"},{"c":"عَنْهُ","d":"ʿanhu","e":"him"},{"c":"مَالُهُ","d":"māluhu","e":"his wealth"},{"c":"وَمَا","d":"wamā","e":"and what"},{"c":"كَسَبَ","d":"kasaba","e":"he earned"}],"a":{"g":"His wealth will not avail him or that which he gained."}},"3":{"w":[{"c":"سَيَصْلَى","d":"sayaṣlā","e":"He will be burnt"},{"c":"نَارًا","d":"nāran","e":"(in) a Fire"},{"c":"ذَاتَ","d":"dhāta","e":"of"},{"c":"لَهَبٍ","d":"lahabin","e":"Blazing Flames"}],"a":{"g":"He will [enter to] burn in a Fire of [blazing] flame"}},"4":{"w":[{"c":"وَامْرَأَتُهُ","d":"wa-im'ra-atuhu","e":"And his wife"},{"c":"حَمَّالَةَ","d":"ḥammālata","e":"(the) carrier"},{"c":"الْحَطَبِ","d":"l-ḥaṭabi","e":"(of) firewood"}],"a":{"g":"And his wife [as well] - the carrier of firewood."}},"5":{"w":[{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"Around"},{"c":"جِيدِهَا","d":"jīdihā","e":"her neck"},{"c":"حَبْلٌ","d":"ḥablun","e":"(will be) a rope"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"of"},{"c":"مَسَدٍ","d":"masadin","e":"palm-fiber"}],"a":{"g":"Around her neck is a rope of [twisted] fiber."}}}